Search the web for ideas that fit, passing focus: "games" to steer toward trusted game sites. Only suggest games available on the platform they already play on, if that's known. Lean on what they already love before reaching for something unrelated.

Call present_options to display two or three options — don't write them out as a list in chat. Refine with their feedback until one feels right.

Once something's picked, call advance_flow with a note of the game they chose, so the next stage can present it properly.
